1
00:01:26,265 --> 00:01:31,025
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:39,625 --> 00:01:41,185
Mother, slow down.

3
00:01:46,865 --> 00:01:47,705
Everyone,

4
00:01:47,785 --> 00:01:48,625
please be seated.

5
00:01:49,705 --> 00:01:50,665
Come.

6
00:01:50,745 --> 00:01:53,825
Today is my mother's 80th birthday.

7
00:01:53,905 --> 00:01:55,985
Thank you all for honoring
us with your presence.

8
00:01:56,065 --> 00:01:58,625
I, Zhao, am deeply grateful.

9
00:02:01,785 --> 00:02:02,745
Come.

10
00:02:02,825 --> 00:02:05,105
Let us drink together.

11
00:02:05,185 --> 00:02:06,105
-Come.
-Come.

12
00:02:06,185 --> 00:02:09,065
May her blessings be as
vast as the Eastern Sea.

13
00:02:09,145 --> 00:02:10,705
And her life as long as
the Southern Mountains.

14
00:02:12,785 --> 00:02:13,785
Shopkeeper.

15
00:02:13,865 --> 00:02:16,145
The Zhao family truly are
great merchants of the capital.

16
00:02:16,225 --> 00:02:18,385
Even the appetizers use
premium red bird's nest.

17
00:02:18,465 --> 00:02:21,065
The deposit alone equals
our entire month's revenue.

18
00:02:22,905 --> 00:02:25,105
Thank you both for coming to celebrate.

19
00:02:25,665 --> 00:02:27,505
-Congratulations.
-A fine day indeed. Cheers.

20
00:02:27,585 --> 00:02:30,825
Wishing you many happy returns.

21
00:02:30,905 --> 00:02:32,025
Cheers.

22
00:02:37,585 --> 00:02:39,145
Profit is secondary.

23
00:02:39,225 --> 00:02:40,705
If we pull off today's banquet,

24
00:02:40,785 --> 00:02:42,465
Bofeng Tavern's reputation will...

25
00:02:46,225 --> 00:02:47,225
Mother, it's me! Mother!

26
00:02:47,785 --> 00:02:48,785
Mother!

27
00:02:48,865 --> 00:02:50,145
What are you doing?

28
00:02:50,985 --> 00:02:52,345
Go!

29
00:03:01,065 --> 00:03:01,945
Murder!

30
00:03:02,505 --> 00:03:03,465
Someone help me!

31
00:03:15,945 --> 00:03:17,065
You crooked establishment!

32
00:03:17,145 --> 00:03:19,065
What did you feed us?

33
00:03:25,185 --> 00:03:26,345
Shopkeeper!

34
00:03:28,865 --> 00:03:30,865
Zhaocai, seal the doors at once.

35
00:03:30,945 --> 00:03:32,625
Jinbao, fetch a physician.

36
00:03:32,705 --> 00:03:34,385
Everyone else, restrain the crazed guests.

37
00:03:34,465 --> 00:03:35,545
-And don't get hurt.
-Yes.

38
00:03:35,625 --> 00:03:36,625
Yes.

39
00:03:37,905 --> 00:03:38,865
The coroner has confirmed it.

40
00:03:38,945 --> 00:03:40,065
All four suffered damage to their organs.

41
00:03:40,145 --> 00:03:41,385
Their pupils were clouded and dilated.

42
00:03:41,465 --> 00:03:43,265
Classic signs of the Infinity Pill
attacking the heart.

43
00:03:43,345 --> 00:03:44,665
More frighteningly,

44
00:03:44,745 --> 00:03:46,225
this poison does not strike suddenly.

45
00:03:46,305 --> 00:03:47,385
It builds up over time,

46
00:03:47,465 --> 00:03:48,545
steadily devouring the mind.

47
00:03:48,625 --> 00:03:49,945
Ling Yunfei again.

48
00:03:50,025 --> 00:03:51,945
Since these men moved at the whistle,

49
00:03:52,025 --> 00:03:54,265
they were clearly trained
assassins willing to die.

50
00:03:54,345 --> 00:03:56,225
Those people who vanished
outside the capital...

51
00:03:57,265 --> 00:03:58,785
Could Ling Yunfei have abducted them all?

52
00:03:59,345 --> 00:04:00,905
Your theory is plausible.

53
00:04:00,985 --> 00:04:03,625
Now we must find where
Ling Yunfei makes the poison.

54
00:04:03,705 --> 00:04:05,185
Only then can we unravel everything.

55
00:04:05,265 --> 00:04:06,905
All four men died violently.

56
00:04:06,985 --> 00:04:08,305
Liu Ruyan was silenced too.

57
00:04:08,385 --> 00:04:09,785
We have no leads left.

58
00:04:09,865 --> 00:04:12,065
What if we trace the ingredients
of the Infinity Pill?

59
00:04:12,145 --> 00:04:14,145
Yinqing, tell us.

60
00:04:14,985 --> 00:04:16,065
My lord.

61
00:04:16,145 --> 00:04:17,225
I examined it carefully.

62
00:04:17,305 --> 00:04:18,865
The main ingredient of the Infinity Pill

63
00:04:18,945 --> 00:04:19,785
is called Fuqing Grass.

64
00:04:19,865 --> 00:04:21,705
Its blossoms are purple and open-faced.

65
00:04:21,785 --> 00:04:23,785
The stamens are clear white,
and the leaves bright green.

66
00:04:23,865 --> 00:04:25,545
They grow staggered along the stem.

67
00:04:25,625 --> 00:04:27,385
But it requires a very particular habitat.

68
00:04:27,465 --> 00:04:28,865
It thrives only in warm, damp places.

69
00:04:31,265 --> 00:04:33,465
Lord Yin, I had no idea.

70
00:04:33,545 --> 00:04:34,945
You know quite a lot.

71
00:04:35,025 --> 00:04:37,585
With so many talents,
why were you never valued before?

72
00:04:37,665 --> 00:04:39,265
Fine horses are common,

73
00:04:39,345 --> 00:04:40,665
but true judges of talent are rare.

74
00:04:40,745 --> 00:04:42,665
Then of course you should thank

75
00:04:43,225 --> 00:04:45,465
our Lord Meng for recognizing your worth.

76
00:04:45,545 --> 00:04:46,945
So you're the hidden gem.

77
00:04:47,505 --> 00:04:50,625
Yinqing, if I didn't know
you were genuinely capable,

78
00:04:50,705 --> 00:04:52,065
I'd seriously suspect

79
00:04:52,145 --> 00:04:53,385
that you joined
the Office of Public Inquiry

80
00:04:53,465 --> 00:04:55,145
on the strength of your flattery alone.

81
00:04:57,665 --> 00:05:00,265
Fuqing Grass is hot and potent in nature.

82
00:05:00,345 --> 00:05:01,585
It causes short-term hallucinations.

83
00:05:01,665 --> 00:05:02,665
With prolonged use,

84
00:05:02,745 --> 00:05:04,865
it drives people into madness and stupor.

85
00:05:04,945 --> 00:05:06,345
Even at the sight of a mosquito,

86
00:05:06,425 --> 00:05:07,945
they'd draw a blade and slash at it.

87
00:05:08,505 --> 00:05:09,945
How is that different
from Five-Stone Powder?

88
00:05:10,985 --> 00:05:12,585
It's a thousand times more potent.

89
00:05:13,145 --> 00:05:14,265
Addiction sets in very quickly.

90
00:05:14,345 --> 00:05:16,225
Besides becoming highly agitated,

91
00:05:16,305 --> 00:05:17,865
users gain a sudden burst of strength,

92
00:05:17,945 --> 00:05:19,385
then die as their bodies burn out.

93
00:05:19,465 --> 00:05:21,705
If such a deadly poison
reaches the streets,

94
00:05:21,785 --> 00:05:23,785
wouldn't it be lethal to the people?

95
00:05:23,865 --> 00:05:25,145
The danger of this poison...

96
00:05:26,625 --> 00:05:28,025
threatens the safety of the people.

97
00:05:28,585 --> 00:05:29,625
If we let it spread unchecked,

98
00:05:30,465 --> 00:05:32,865
the realm of Daning
itself will be imperiled.

99
00:05:32,945 --> 00:05:33,785
A Nian.

100
00:05:33,865 --> 00:05:34,705
Do you know of

101
00:05:34,785 --> 00:05:36,545
any unusual valley where
Fuqing Grass could grow?

102
00:05:36,625 --> 00:05:38,745
Such a valley would be distinctive,

103
00:05:39,265 --> 00:05:40,625
but Daning is vast.

104
00:05:40,705 --> 00:05:42,505
Searching them one by one

105
00:05:42,585 --> 00:05:43,865
would be like finding a needle in the sea.

106
00:05:43,945 --> 00:05:45,545
You haven't eaten anything,

107
00:05:45,625 --> 00:05:46,585
so I prepared some pastries.

108
00:05:47,665 --> 00:05:48,785
Our gifted Lady Shen

109
00:05:48,865 --> 00:05:50,865
normally never sets foot in the kitchen.

110
00:05:51,425 --> 00:05:53,705
-Are these even edible?
-Then do not eat them.

111
00:05:53,785 --> 00:05:55,345
-Someone will...
-I love them.

112
00:05:57,225 --> 00:06:00,825
Lord Shen, your tongue is usually
as sweet as honey.

113
00:06:00,905 --> 00:06:03,425
Why are you so hard on your own sister?

114
00:06:04,185 --> 00:06:05,025
I was wrong.

115
00:06:05,945 --> 00:06:07,505
Anything my own sister makes,

116
00:06:07,585 --> 00:06:08,665
how could I possibly call it bad?

117
00:06:09,465 --> 00:06:12,625
Even the presentation is
as lovely as a painting.

118
00:06:14,225 --> 00:06:15,385
A painting...

119
00:06:17,385 --> 00:06:19,545
Liu Ruyan's painting. Yinqing.

120
00:06:24,985 --> 00:06:27,225
Liu Ruyan hid this painting
in a secret compartment.

121
00:06:27,305 --> 00:06:28,305
That means the place in it

122
00:06:28,385 --> 00:06:29,745
was not painted at random.

123
00:06:30,305 --> 00:06:31,745
She may actually have been there.

124
00:06:31,825 --> 00:06:34,425
Hibiscus thrives in warm, humid places,

125
00:06:34,505 --> 00:06:36,425
just like Fuqing Grass.

126
00:06:36,505 --> 00:06:37,465
Di Nian.

127
00:06:37,545 --> 00:06:39,425
Take men and search the outskirts
of the capital at once

128
00:06:39,505 --> 00:06:40,905
for terrain matching this painting.

129
00:06:40,985 --> 00:06:41,945
Lord Meng.

130
00:06:43,065 --> 00:06:43,985
Lord Meng!

131
00:06:44,065 --> 00:06:45,105
Bofeng Tavern...

132
00:06:45,185 --> 00:06:46,425
Something terrible
happened at Bofeng Tavern!

133
00:06:51,545 --> 00:06:52,545
Stop!

134
00:06:52,625 --> 00:06:54,465
-Give me back my husband!
-Stop! What are you doing?

135
00:06:55,145 --> 00:06:56,145
Fuzhi.

136
00:06:56,585 --> 00:06:57,465
Lord Meng.

137
00:06:57,545 --> 00:06:59,865
You must seek justice for us!

138
00:06:59,945 --> 00:07:01,785
I held the birthday banquet here

139
00:07:01,865 --> 00:07:04,025
only out of respect for you.

140
00:07:04,105 --> 00:07:06,185
If anything happens to my husband,

141
00:07:06,785 --> 00:07:07,985
how am I supposed to live?

142
00:07:08,065 --> 00:07:10,305
Even with you backing her, Lord Meng,

143
00:07:10,385 --> 00:07:12,305
Proprietor Yan still
owes us an explanation.

144
00:07:12,385 --> 00:07:13,545
Exactly!

145
00:07:13,625 --> 00:07:15,465
No one leaves until we get an explanation!

146
00:07:15,545 --> 00:07:18,065
-No one leaves!
-No one leaves!

147
00:07:18,825 --> 00:07:20,025
What are you doing?

148
00:07:20,465 --> 00:07:21,425
Stop!

149
00:07:24,345 --> 00:07:25,425
If you want justice,

150
00:07:26,025 --> 00:07:26,905
help me save them.

151
00:07:27,545 --> 00:07:28,945
If you want bloodshed,

152
00:07:29,665 --> 00:07:30,625
I will not be merciful.

153
00:07:31,265 --> 00:07:33,385
-Save them!
-Save them!

154
00:07:37,025 --> 00:07:38,625
Husband!

155
00:07:58,145 --> 00:07:59,305
My lord.

156
00:07:59,385 --> 00:08:00,225
The wine is poisoned.

157
00:08:00,785 --> 00:08:02,065
Judging by how potent it is,

158
00:08:02,145 --> 00:08:03,665
it is most likely the Infinity Pill.

159
00:08:04,305 --> 00:08:05,225
The Tiger's Roar Gang.

160
00:08:07,705 --> 00:08:08,985
They must be targeting me.

161
00:08:09,545 --> 00:08:11,065
These people need treatment immediately,

162
00:08:11,145 --> 00:08:12,265
or their lives are in danger.

163
00:08:12,745 --> 00:08:13,625
Where is Lady Yan?

164
00:08:13,705 --> 00:08:15,505
She was just here. How did she vanish?

165
00:08:15,585 --> 00:08:17,025
Lord Meng.

166
00:08:23,945 --> 00:08:25,145
Meng Tinghui.

167
00:08:25,225 --> 00:08:26,785
You killed the woman I loved most.

168
00:08:26,865 --> 00:08:29,225
I will make the person dearest
to you suffer worse than death.

169
00:08:29,305 --> 00:08:30,825
If you want to save Yan Fuzhi,

170
00:08:30,905 --> 00:08:32,505
come alone as agreed.

171
00:08:32,585 --> 00:08:34,545
Otherwise, prepare to collect her body.

172
00:08:35,185 --> 00:08:36,025
Fuzhi...

173
00:08:45,145 --> 00:08:47,145
Before the evening watch today,

174
00:08:47,225 --> 00:08:49,385
if the court does not
hand over Meng Tinghui,

175
00:08:49,465 --> 00:08:52,025
I will drench the capital
in blood with Infinity Pills.

176
00:08:52,105 --> 00:08:53,465
Ling Yunfei.

177
00:08:54,825 --> 00:08:55,665
Shunzi.

178
00:08:56,185 --> 00:08:57,585
Run!

179
00:08:58,825 --> 00:09:00,025
-Run!
-Run!

180
00:09:13,105 --> 00:09:14,185
Absurd!

181
00:09:14,825 --> 00:09:17,545
How dare the Tiger's Roar Gang
be this brazen?

182
00:09:17,625 --> 00:09:18,825
Your Majesty, please hear me.

183
00:09:19,385 --> 00:09:20,505
The Tiger's Roar Gang must be destroyed,

184
00:09:20,585 --> 00:09:21,865
and Ling Yunfei must be captured.

185
00:09:21,945 --> 00:09:23,865
But the people must also be reassured.

186
00:09:23,945 --> 00:09:24,985
I heard that at Bofeng Tavern

187
00:09:25,065 --> 00:09:26,585
many people were poisoned.

188
00:09:26,665 --> 00:09:28,705
The capital clinics are
already overflowing,

189
00:09:28,785 --> 00:09:31,465
and threatening letters are everywhere.

190
00:09:31,545 --> 00:09:33,345
The whole city is in panic.

191
00:09:33,425 --> 00:09:36,545
All of this began because of Meng Tinghui.

192
00:09:36,625 --> 00:09:38,225
If we hand over just one person,

193
00:09:38,305 --> 00:09:39,785
we can hold Ling Yunfei at bay

194
00:09:39,865 --> 00:09:41,225
and calm the people.

195
00:09:41,305 --> 00:09:42,945
It is the best course.

196
00:09:43,025 --> 00:09:44,625
Your Majesty, I agree.

197
00:09:44,705 --> 00:09:46,625
Meng Tinghui may have
been punishing evildoers,

198
00:09:46,705 --> 00:09:48,025
but she also provoked
the Tiger's Roar Gang.

199
00:09:48,545 --> 00:09:49,865
If Your Majesty keeps shielding her,

200
00:09:49,945 --> 00:09:50,985
the people may question
Your Majesty's judgment.

201
00:09:51,545 --> 00:09:53,945
Ling Yunfei posted threats
all across the city.

202
00:09:54,025 --> 00:09:55,465
Is Meng Tinghui the one he is challenging?

203
00:09:55,545 --> 00:09:57,745
He is challenging me,

204
00:09:57,825 --> 00:09:59,145
and the authority of Daning.

205
00:10:00,185 --> 00:10:01,585
If I retreat today,

206
00:10:02,065 --> 00:10:03,665
that would truly be an unwise act.

207
00:10:03,745 --> 00:10:05,705
Your Majesty, all the civil
and military officials

208
00:10:05,785 --> 00:10:07,425
are waiting before the main hall.

209
00:10:07,985 --> 00:10:09,625
If Your Majesty still
refuses to hand her over,

210
00:10:09,705 --> 00:10:10,585
it will be hard to convince them.

211
00:10:10,665 --> 00:10:12,145
Today, not only Meng Tinghui,

212
00:10:12,225 --> 00:10:13,825
but anyone in this court

213
00:10:13,905 --> 00:10:15,145
would never be surrendered by me.

214
00:10:16,425 --> 00:10:18,545
Instead of joining forces
to suppress the gang,

215
00:10:18,625 --> 00:10:21,025
you two submit a joint
memorial to force my hand.

216
00:10:21,105 --> 00:10:22,225
But, Your Majesty,

217
00:10:22,305 --> 00:10:24,065
less than three hours remain
before the evening watch.

218
00:10:24,145 --> 00:10:25,305
If the search fails

219
00:10:25,385 --> 00:10:26,865
and the Tiger's Roar Gang
still holds the Infinity Pills,

220
00:10:26,945 --> 00:10:29,025
the streets of the capital
may be littered with bodies.

221
00:10:29,105 --> 00:10:30,425
How will we answer for that?

222
00:10:30,905 --> 00:10:31,745
Your Majesty.

223
00:10:33,905 --> 00:10:35,065
Your Majesty, I have a report.

224
00:10:35,145 --> 00:10:36,385
Lord Meng requests an audience.

225
00:10:36,465 --> 00:10:38,305
She has also volunteered to go

226
00:10:38,985 --> 00:10:40,465
meet Ling Yunfei.

227
00:10:50,185 --> 00:10:51,785
Seal every exit.

228
00:10:51,865 --> 00:10:53,225
-Search.
-Yes.

229
00:10:54,945 --> 00:10:55,785
Your Majesty.

230
00:10:55,865 --> 00:10:58,105
The situation is urgent.
There is no time to lose.

231
00:10:58,185 --> 00:10:59,865
Please allow me to go alone as agreed.

232
00:10:59,945 --> 00:11:01,185
This concerns the dignity of Daning.

233
00:11:01,265 --> 00:11:02,705
This is no time for you to play the hero.

234
00:11:03,425 --> 00:11:06,785
I sent Zhishu, Di Nian, and Huang Bo
to hunt Ling Yunfei and his gang citywide.

235
00:11:06,865 --> 00:11:08,265
This matter is not open for discussion.

236
00:11:08,345 --> 00:11:09,625
Ling Yunfei believes

237
00:11:09,705 --> 00:11:11,105
that Liu Ruyan died by my hand.

238
00:11:11,585 --> 00:11:12,665
He wants a life for a life.

239
00:11:12,745 --> 00:11:13,945
If my life alone

240
00:11:14,025 --> 00:11:16,545
-could save Fuzhi and the whole capital—
-Meng Tinghui!

241
00:11:16,625 --> 00:11:18,105
This involves the criminal
underworld of Daning.

242
00:11:18,745 --> 00:11:19,745
Do you think this is a game?

243
00:11:21,025 --> 00:11:22,065
My decision is final.

244
00:11:22,945 --> 00:11:23,825
You may leave.

245
00:11:23,905 --> 00:11:25,505
My mind is made up as well.

246
00:11:26,825 --> 00:11:27,825
Even if I die,

247
00:11:28,985 --> 00:11:30,345
I must go.

248
00:11:36,505 --> 00:11:38,305
She dared openly defy His Majesty.

249
00:11:38,385 --> 00:11:39,705
Lord Meng truly is

250
00:11:39,785 --> 00:11:40,865
remarkably bold.

251
00:11:43,665 --> 00:11:44,585
Lord Meng.

252
00:11:45,065 --> 00:11:46,985
My brother has already
gone to find Lady Yan.

253
00:11:47,065 --> 00:11:49,385
His Majesty also sent the Divine Guard
to search the capital.

254
00:11:49,465 --> 00:11:50,745
They will surely find Fuzhi.

255
00:11:51,225 --> 00:11:52,505
Why risk your own life?

256
00:11:54,745 --> 00:11:57,145
I am going for Fuzhi,

257
00:11:57,225 --> 00:11:58,625
and for the people of the capital.

258
00:11:59,545 --> 00:12:00,825
Ling Yunfei wants me.

259
00:12:01,345 --> 00:12:02,905
It is time I settled this with him.

260
00:12:02,985 --> 00:12:04,665
My lord, I know we cannot
talk you out of it.

261
00:12:04,745 --> 00:12:05,585
Then how about this?

262
00:12:06,145 --> 00:12:07,145
I will go in your place.

263
00:12:07,225 --> 00:12:08,545
I have followed you for so long

264
00:12:09,105 --> 00:12:10,065
that your manner and speech

265
00:12:10,145 --> 00:12:11,225
are easy enough for me to imitate.

266
00:12:11,305 --> 00:12:12,545
Ling Yunfei will not recognize me.

267
00:12:12,625 --> 00:12:14,465
Can Ling Yunfei not
tell a man from a woman?

268
00:12:15,305 --> 00:12:17,385
He specifically ordered me to come alone.

269
00:12:18,025 --> 00:12:19,265
If he sees anyone else,

270
00:12:19,345 --> 00:12:20,625
Fuzhi's life will be in danger.

271
00:12:21,785 --> 00:12:23,025
In this game,

272
00:12:23,105 --> 00:12:24,745
we must play by his rules.

273
00:12:24,825 --> 00:12:27,185
My lord, if you insist on going,

274
00:12:27,265 --> 00:12:28,465
this soup

275
00:12:28,545 --> 00:12:30,225
contains Ten-Tonic Vitality Powder.

276
00:12:30,825 --> 00:12:32,585
Even someone with no inner strength

277
00:12:32,665 --> 00:12:33,905
will become stronger and hardier

278
00:12:33,985 --> 00:12:35,225
and move as swiftly as the wind.

279
00:12:35,305 --> 00:12:36,585
You must drink it

280
00:12:36,665 --> 00:12:37,505
before we let you leave.

281
00:12:37,585 --> 00:12:39,065
Yes.

282
00:12:39,145 --> 00:12:40,305
At least take this medicine

283
00:12:40,385 --> 00:12:41,585
so we can have some peace of mind.

284
00:12:58,545 --> 00:12:59,385
I'm going.

285
00:13:14,865 --> 00:13:15,905
You...

286
00:13:15,985 --> 00:13:17,145
You drugged me.

287
00:13:20,665 --> 00:13:21,545
Forgive us, my lord.

288
00:13:22,025 --> 00:13:23,545
It was the only way.

289
00:13:29,625 --> 00:13:31,705
You can sleep soundly
until tomorrow morning.

290
00:13:31,785 --> 00:13:33,105
When she wakes,

291
00:13:33,185 --> 00:13:36,025
she may punish me or hate
me. I accept it all.

292
00:13:36,105 --> 00:13:37,305
I will take men right now

293
00:13:37,385 --> 00:13:38,265
to find Lady Yan.

294
00:13:38,345 --> 00:13:40,745
I will recheck the clues
from Wanxiang House.

295
00:13:56,745 --> 00:13:58,585
Search carefully, all of you.

296
00:13:58,665 --> 00:13:59,505
-Yes.
-Yes.

297
00:14:16,425 --> 00:14:17,265
Found it.

298
00:14:19,425 --> 00:14:20,505
Your Majesty.

299
00:14:20,585 --> 00:14:23,265
Your Majesty, this is the glowstone
powder Lord Meng left behind.

300
00:14:29,345 --> 00:14:30,705
If you insist on going,

301
00:14:31,385 --> 00:14:33,105
I will have men protect you in secret.

302
00:14:33,185 --> 00:14:34,945
Ling Yunfei demanded that I come alone.

303
00:14:35,545 --> 00:14:36,825
If he notices anything unusual,

304
00:14:36,905 --> 00:14:39,465
-Fuzhi's life...
-This is my final concession.

305
00:14:45,465 --> 00:14:47,345
You are an official of Daning.

306
00:14:47,425 --> 00:14:49,265
I will never let you face danger alone.

307
00:14:50,105 --> 00:14:51,385
Leave markers along the way.

308
00:14:51,465 --> 00:14:53,425
Zhishu and Di Nian will follow in secret

309
00:14:53,505 --> 00:14:54,905
without alerting Ling Yunfei.

310
00:14:54,985 --> 00:14:56,505
Once I meet Ling Yunfei,

311
00:14:57,745 --> 00:14:59,785
I will light a red flame as the signal.

312
00:14:59,865 --> 00:15:01,025
Remember.

313
00:15:01,105 --> 00:15:02,025
On this mission,

314
00:15:02,665 --> 00:15:03,785
your safety and Lady Yan's

315
00:15:03,865 --> 00:15:05,065
must come before everything else.

316
00:15:08,105 --> 00:15:08,945
Your Majesty.

317
00:15:09,425 --> 00:15:10,625
The forest is dark.
There may be an ambush.

318
00:15:10,705 --> 00:15:12,105
Perhaps Your Majesty should
return to the palace.

319
00:15:12,185 --> 00:15:13,625
We will rescue Lord Meng and Lady Yan.

320
00:15:13,705 --> 00:15:15,305
Huang is right.

321
00:15:15,385 --> 00:15:16,705
Ling Yunfei is ruthless.

322
00:15:16,785 --> 00:15:18,465
-If Your Majesty is harmed...
-All the more reason.

323
00:15:19,025 --> 00:15:21,105
I must capture them with my own hands.

324
00:15:27,625 --> 00:15:28,665
Come. To the palace.

325
00:15:28,745 --> 00:15:29,625
Leyan.

326
00:15:30,105 --> 00:15:30,985
Teacher.

327
00:15:31,065 --> 00:15:32,185
Why are you here so late?

328
00:15:32,265 --> 00:15:33,625
Ling Yunfei is devious,

329
00:15:33,705 --> 00:15:35,785
and the Office of Public
Inquiry is his first target.

330
00:15:36,345 --> 00:15:38,545
I was worried about you.
Are you heading home?

331
00:15:39,145 --> 00:15:40,425
I am going to the palace.

332
00:15:40,505 --> 00:15:41,345
Leyan.

333
00:15:41,425 --> 00:15:42,865
What is so urgent?

334
00:15:42,945 --> 00:15:44,145
Lord Meng is missing.

335
00:15:44,225 --> 00:15:46,025
She must have gone alone
to meet Ling Yunfei.

336
00:15:46,105 --> 00:15:47,505
Yinqing already led
the Light Cavalry out of the city.

337
00:15:47,585 --> 00:15:48,865
But without anyone to support her,

338
00:15:48,945 --> 00:15:50,625
she is in grave danger going alone.

339
00:15:50,705 --> 00:15:51,905
I must report to His Majesty

340
00:15:51,985 --> 00:15:52,905
and ask him to send reinforcements.

341
00:15:52,985 --> 00:15:54,265
Where are Lieutenant Di

342
00:15:54,345 --> 00:15:55,225
and your brother now?

343
00:15:55,945 --> 00:15:56,785
My brother...

344
00:15:56,865 --> 00:15:58,065
He already left to find Lady Yan

345
00:15:58,145 --> 00:15:59,585
and track down Ling Yunfei.

346
00:15:59,665 --> 00:16:00,785
A Nian

347
00:16:00,865 --> 00:16:02,105
may be attending His Majesty.

348
00:16:02,185 --> 00:16:03,785
Ling Yunfei

349
00:16:03,865 --> 00:16:05,945
will surely spare no one
from the Office of Public Inquiry.

350
00:16:06,025 --> 00:16:07,585
Your brother and Di Nian

351
00:16:07,665 --> 00:16:08,745
are both away from the residence.

352
00:16:08,825 --> 00:16:10,545
Who will protect the Shen household?

353
00:16:10,625 --> 00:16:12,065
Deploy the household guards at once

354
00:16:12,145 --> 00:16:13,425
and keep the Shen residence
under tight guard.

355
00:16:13,505 --> 00:16:14,745
I will go to the palace in your place.

356
00:16:14,825 --> 00:16:16,585
But if His Majesty asks for details...

357
00:16:16,665 --> 00:16:17,825
His Majesty knows

358
00:16:17,905 --> 00:16:19,185
Lord Meng's temperament very well.

359
00:16:19,785 --> 00:16:22,185
I will explain everything properly to him.

360
00:16:22,265 --> 00:16:23,265
Do not worry.

361
00:16:24,025 --> 00:16:26,185
Take care of yourself and your family.

362
00:16:43,465 --> 00:16:44,465
Lord Meng.

363
00:16:45,625 --> 00:16:47,665
Have you not always wanted to capture me?

364
00:16:47,745 --> 00:16:48,825
Enough talk.

365
00:16:48,905 --> 00:16:50,865
I am here.

366
00:16:52,105 --> 00:16:53,345
Release Yan Fuzhi.

367
00:16:53,425 --> 00:16:54,545
What is the rush?

368
00:16:55,905 --> 00:16:57,665
The show has only just begun.

369
00:16:57,745 --> 00:16:58,585
Let me go!

370
00:17:03,705 --> 00:17:04,545
Fuzhi!

371
00:17:10,305 --> 00:17:12,865
I have dreamed of you
often these past few days.

372
00:17:13,345 --> 00:17:14,265
In my dreams,

373
00:17:15,065 --> 00:17:16,265
you were just like this,

374
00:17:16,345 --> 00:17:18,225
kneeling at my feet and begging for mercy.

375
00:17:22,345 --> 00:17:23,945
I truly cannot understand it.

376
00:17:25,585 --> 00:17:27,745
You and I stayed out of each other's way.

377
00:17:29,385 --> 00:17:31,585
Why did you insist on hounding me?

378
00:17:32,145 --> 00:17:34,425
Everything I built with my own hands

379
00:17:34,505 --> 00:17:36,145
was wiped out by you people.

380
00:17:36,705 --> 00:17:39,025
And the woman I loved
most died because of you.

381
00:17:42,265 --> 00:17:43,345
Tell me.

382
00:17:43,985 --> 00:17:45,385
This blood debt...

383
00:17:45,465 --> 00:17:46,905
How will you repay it?

384
00:17:47,665 --> 00:17:48,505
Ling Yunfei.

385
00:17:50,545 --> 00:17:52,665
As for how this blood debt is repaid,

386
00:17:54,185 --> 00:17:55,305
we will do it your way.

387
00:17:55,385 --> 00:17:56,785
But first,

388
00:17:57,545 --> 00:17:58,945
release Yan Fuzhi.

389
00:17:59,505 --> 00:18:00,705
If you dare touch her,

390
00:18:02,105 --> 00:18:04,065
I will grind your bones to dust.

391
00:18:09,145 --> 00:18:11,065
What touching sisterly devotion.

392
00:18:15,585 --> 00:18:17,865
Have you not been investigating
the Infinity Pills?

393
00:18:25,065 --> 00:18:26,505
Mengmeng!

394
00:18:26,585 --> 00:18:27,425
Let her go!

395
00:18:28,225 --> 00:18:29,785
Let her go and come at me instead!

396
00:18:33,745 --> 00:18:34,745
As you wish.

397
00:18:36,865 --> 00:18:38,025
Ling Yunfei!

398
00:18:38,105 --> 00:18:39,265
Do not hurt Fuzhi.

399
00:18:39,825 --> 00:18:42,065
Someone else truly killed Liu Ruyan.

400
00:18:42,745 --> 00:18:43,785
You are taking revenge
on the wrong person.

401
00:18:43,865 --> 00:18:45,465
Even if we both die today,

402
00:18:46,425 --> 00:18:48,185
Liu Ruyan in the afterlife

403
00:18:48,265 --> 00:18:49,265
will still be unable to rest in peace.

404
00:18:52,025 --> 00:18:53,385
I came here alone today.

405
00:18:53,465 --> 00:18:54,905
I am not even afraid to die.

406
00:18:55,585 --> 00:18:56,825
Why would I lie to you?

407
00:18:56,905 --> 00:18:58,665
That day, I needed Liu Ruyan alive

408
00:18:58,745 --> 00:18:59,865
to learn your whereabouts.

409
00:19:00,785 --> 00:19:02,545
Why would I have struck rashly?

410
00:19:04,225 --> 00:19:07,025
Even if she did not kill
Sister Ruyan herself,

411
00:19:07,105 --> 00:19:08,585
she still drove her to her death.

412
00:19:08,665 --> 00:19:10,305
And there is my brother's blood feud,

413
00:19:10,385 --> 00:19:12,225
and the lives of dozens of our brothers.

414
00:19:12,905 --> 00:19:15,225
If we do not tear her limb from limb
today,

415
00:19:15,305 --> 00:19:16,465
we will have failed Sister Ruyan

416
00:19:16,545 --> 00:19:17,745
and our fallen brothers.

417
00:19:24,585 --> 00:19:25,865
This should be the place.

418
00:19:25,945 --> 00:19:26,905
We are running out of time.

419
00:19:27,425 --> 00:19:28,265
Go.

420
00:19:36,625 --> 00:19:38,985
Sir, Ying Gua has led troops
into the Tiger's Roar Gang.

421
00:19:39,865 --> 00:19:40,945
We should avoid a direct clash.

422
00:19:45,425 --> 00:19:49,345
Stop! Let her go!

423
00:19:49,425 --> 00:19:50,305
Fuzhi!

424
00:19:51,145 --> 00:19:52,065
Let her go!

425
00:19:52,145 --> 00:19:53,425
Do you not want revenge?

426
00:19:53,505 --> 00:19:54,505
Come at me!

427
00:19:56,505 --> 00:19:57,785
Stop!

428
00:19:58,105 --> 00:19:59,625
Stop feeding her!

429
00:20:00,585 --> 00:20:01,545
Stop!

430
00:20:02,105 --> 00:20:03,185
Let her go!

431
00:20:06,425 --> 00:20:07,265
No!

432
00:20:10,785 --> 00:20:11,625
No!

433
00:20:11,705 --> 00:20:13,505
Such devoted sisters.

434
00:20:13,585 --> 00:20:15,505
If she wants it so badly, give her more.

435
00:20:17,945 --> 00:20:19,785
I killed Liu Ruyan with my own hands.

436
00:20:20,825 --> 00:20:21,985
I killed her myself.

437
00:20:22,785 --> 00:20:23,825
It was me.

438
00:20:24,385 --> 00:20:25,545
I watched her with my own eyes

439
00:20:25,625 --> 00:20:27,105
die by my hand.

440
00:20:27,185 --> 00:20:30,265
Before she died, she
put on her finest makeup

441
00:20:31,825 --> 00:20:33,345
and wore her most splendid clothes.

442
00:20:35,345 --> 00:20:37,705
She waited for you, full of hope.

443
00:20:38,905 --> 00:20:39,745
What a pity.

444
00:20:41,585 --> 00:20:43,865
You never even saw her one last time.

445
00:20:51,785 --> 00:20:53,665
Do you not want to avenge her?

446
00:20:55,945 --> 00:20:56,985
Kill me.

447
00:20:57,065 --> 00:20:58,665
Kill me right now!

448
00:21:07,425 --> 00:21:08,545
Today,

449
00:21:09,145 --> 00:21:10,945
I will send you to join Ruyan in death.

450
00:21:12,745 --> 00:21:13,745
Ling Yunfei!

451
00:21:22,745 --> 00:21:23,745
Fuzhi!

452
00:21:30,905 --> 00:21:32,105
Chief!

453
00:21:42,625 --> 00:21:43,785
Raid the Tiger's Roar Gang!

454
00:21:43,865 --> 00:21:45,625
-After him!
-Yes!

455
00:21:46,345 --> 00:21:47,185
Fuzhi.

456
00:21:47,745 --> 00:21:48,625
Are you hurt?

457
00:21:49,625 --> 00:21:50,465
I am fine.

458
00:21:51,265 --> 00:21:53,705
Fuzhi, what is wrong?

459
00:21:53,785 --> 00:21:55,145
They forced her to take an Infinity Pill.

460
00:21:56,985 --> 00:21:57,825
Fuzhi!

461
00:22:02,185 --> 00:22:03,545
As you ordered,

462
00:22:03,625 --> 00:22:04,985
Chief Ling has withdrawn safely.

463
00:22:08,425 --> 00:22:10,585
Ling Yunfei is a useful blade.

464
00:22:10,665 --> 00:22:11,785
It would be a waste to lose him.

465
00:22:11,865 --> 00:22:14,185
Besides, he knows far too many secrets.

466
00:22:16,425 --> 00:22:17,505
Dead or alive,

467
00:22:18,105 --> 00:22:20,145
he must never fall into
the hands of the court.

468
00:22:20,705 --> 00:22:21,585
Rest assured, Master.

469
00:22:22,225 --> 00:22:24,105
The court may have raided
the Tiger's Roar Gang,

470
00:22:24,185 --> 00:22:25,145
but the secret passage has been destroyed.

471
00:22:25,225 --> 00:22:26,465
For the time being,

472
00:22:26,545 --> 00:22:27,825
they will not find his hiding place.

473
00:22:34,185 --> 00:22:35,345
Fuzhi.

474
00:22:36,305 --> 00:22:37,145
Fuzhi!

475
00:22:38,065 --> 00:22:38,905
Calm down.

476
00:22:39,745 --> 00:22:42,665
Stop smashing things, Fuzhi!

477
00:22:43,585 --> 00:22:44,865
Fuzhi!

478
00:22:44,945 --> 00:22:46,065
Calm down!

479
00:22:46,625 --> 00:22:47,905
Hold on.

480
00:22:52,745 --> 00:22:53,705
Fuzhi!

481
00:22:53,785 --> 00:22:56,265
Fuzhi, stop smashing things! Fuzhi!

482
00:22:57,025 --> 00:22:58,105
Stop!

483
00:23:00,385 --> 00:23:01,985
Fuzhi!

484
00:23:03,305 --> 00:23:07,505
Hold on.

485
00:23:07,585 --> 00:23:09,065
Fuzhi!

486
00:23:10,985 --> 00:23:11,825
Fuzhi!

487
00:23:11,905 --> 00:23:13,465
Once you get through
this, you will be all right.

488
00:23:14,905 --> 00:23:16,345
Hold on a little longer, all right?

489
00:23:20,345 --> 00:23:21,585
It is all right.

490
00:23:34,865 --> 00:23:36,985
Mengmeng.

491
00:23:37,065 --> 00:23:38,785
Give me an Infinity Pill.

492
00:23:39,625 --> 00:23:41,745
Please, give me an Infinity Pill.

493
00:23:41,825 --> 00:23:44,665
-I feel awful.
-Fuzhi.

494
00:23:44,745 --> 00:23:46,145
Give me an Infinity Pill.

495
00:23:47,425 --> 00:23:49,665
Once you get through
this, you will be all right.

496
00:23:55,665 --> 00:23:57,305
Zhishu.

497
00:23:57,385 --> 00:23:59,345
Give me an Infinity Pill.

498
00:23:59,425 --> 00:24:00,385
Please.

499
00:24:00,465 --> 00:24:01,545
Give me an Infinity Pill.

500
00:24:01,625 --> 00:24:03,905
I feel awful. Give me an Infinity Pill.

501
00:24:03,985 --> 00:24:04,825
Please.

502
00:24:04,905 --> 00:24:06,785
Fuzhi, the Infinity Pill will destroy you.

503
00:24:06,865 --> 00:24:08,425
I feel awful.

504
00:24:08,505 --> 00:24:09,345
Fuzhi.

505
00:24:11,505 --> 00:24:13,865
Wake up!

506
00:24:17,545 --> 00:24:18,905
Fuzhi, let go!

507
00:24:18,985 --> 00:24:20,705
Fuzhi, release me!

508
00:24:20,785 --> 00:24:22,385
-Stop biting!
-My lord!

509
00:24:22,465 --> 00:24:23,425
-Fuzhi!
-My lord!

510
00:24:23,505 --> 00:24:25,025
Tie Lady Yan up first.

511
00:24:25,105 --> 00:24:26,425
She may hurt us when another attack comes.

512
00:24:29,465 --> 00:24:30,465
Let go!

513
00:24:33,305 --> 00:24:34,945
Give me an Infinity Pill!

514
00:24:35,025 --> 00:24:36,265
Or I will kill all of you!

515
00:24:36,345 --> 00:24:37,505
Yan Fuzhi!

516
00:24:37,585 --> 00:24:40,305
-Put down the knife!
-Fuzhi, do not hurt yourself!

517
00:24:40,385 --> 00:24:41,465
Lady Yan!

518
00:24:49,745 --> 00:24:50,665
Lord Shen, quickly!

519
00:24:59,065 --> 00:24:59,905
Let me go!

520
00:24:59,985 --> 00:25:00,865
Lord Meng.

521
00:25:00,945 --> 00:25:03,585
If we do not restrain
her, she may hurt herself too.

522
00:25:11,585 --> 00:25:12,425
Fuzhi.

523
00:25:14,185 --> 00:25:15,025
Fuzhi.

524
00:25:15,545 --> 00:25:16,385
Fuzhi.

525
00:25:18,025 --> 00:25:20,745
Kill me.

526
00:25:21,865 --> 00:25:23,505
It hurts too much.

527
00:25:26,905 --> 00:25:28,585
I cannot bear it.

528
00:25:28,665 --> 00:25:29,945
I am begging you.

529
00:25:30,305 --> 00:25:33,945
Kill me.

530
00:25:35,385 --> 00:25:36,585
Kill me!

531
00:25:40,425 --> 00:25:41,505
Fuzhi.

532
00:25:56,265 --> 00:25:57,505
Yinqing.

533
00:25:58,505 --> 00:26:00,305
You have always been skilled with poisons.

534
00:26:06,185 --> 00:26:08,105
Please, save Fuzhi.

535
00:26:10,305 --> 00:26:12,025
-My lord...
-Please think of something!

536
00:26:12,105 --> 00:26:13,545
Please get up first.

537
00:26:13,625 --> 00:26:17,345
I beg you. Find a way to save her.

538
00:26:22,825 --> 00:26:24,945
Fuzhi is my only family.

539
00:26:28,145 --> 00:26:30,425
Even if it costs my life,

540
00:26:31,425 --> 00:26:32,305
I would give it willingly.

541
00:26:33,825 --> 00:26:34,865
My lord, please get up.

542
00:26:35,505 --> 00:26:36,825
If Lady Yan can be saved,

543
00:26:37,905 --> 00:26:39,145
even if it costs everything I have,

544
00:26:40,225 --> 00:26:41,545
I will not hesitate.

545
00:26:42,265 --> 00:26:43,185
My lord.

546
00:26:43,665 --> 00:26:44,585
Lord Shen.

547
00:26:45,625 --> 00:26:46,985
This poison is extraordinarily strange.

548
00:26:47,825 --> 00:26:50,385
His Majesty sent Imperial Physician Li
to examine her personally,

549
00:26:50,465 --> 00:26:52,025
but he could do nothing.

550
00:26:52,105 --> 00:26:53,585
I searched every medical text

551
00:26:54,465 --> 00:26:55,745
and found no cure.

552
00:26:55,825 --> 00:26:57,585
Even if we begin developing an antidote,

553
00:26:58,225 --> 00:26:59,985
it could take months, perhaps years.

554
00:27:00,065 --> 00:27:01,465
But Lady Yan...

555
00:27:05,425 --> 00:27:06,705
may have only three days.

556
00:27:13,145 --> 00:27:15,065
If she can endure this ordeal herself,

557
00:27:15,625 --> 00:27:17,505
the poison will gradually weaken.

558
00:27:17,585 --> 00:27:18,705
Three days...

559
00:27:23,705 --> 00:27:25,025
Three days.

560
00:27:44,025 --> 00:27:44,865
Fuzhi.

561
00:27:47,705 --> 00:27:48,545
Fuzhi.

562
00:27:50,025 --> 00:27:50,905
Hold on.

563
00:27:51,865 --> 00:27:54,225
Bofeng Tavern has not
spread across Daning yet.

564
00:27:55,025 --> 00:27:56,465
Rank, wealth, glory...

565
00:27:57,985 --> 00:27:59,305
I do not want any of it.

566
00:28:00,385 --> 00:28:01,785
Let us go back to Shazhou.

567
00:28:03,865 --> 00:28:06,025
I only want you standing safely before me.

568
00:28:09,185 --> 00:28:10,225
Please.

569
00:28:12,065 --> 00:28:13,225
Do not leave me.

570
00:28:17,105 --> 00:28:18,025
Please.

571
00:28:21,905 --> 00:28:23,345
Please...

572
00:28:23,425 --> 00:28:25,305
I heard Jiang Mei'er came
looking for trouble again.

573
00:28:25,785 --> 00:28:26,625
Does she really think we are easy targets?

574
00:28:26,705 --> 00:28:29,385
I'll avenge you
by bashing her with an abacus.

575
00:28:29,465 --> 00:28:32,105
But to me, nothing is worth
risking your life for.

576
00:28:32,665 --> 00:28:33,705
Let us make our way in the capital.

577
00:28:34,545 --> 00:28:35,865
You open a tavern,

578
00:28:35,945 --> 00:28:36,905
and I will sit the imperial examination.

579
00:28:36,985 --> 00:28:40,345
-Together, we'll make our mark.
-Capital, here we come!

580
00:28:40,425 --> 00:28:42,545
Here we come!

581
00:28:42,625 --> 00:28:43,625
I got this at Lingquan Temple

582
00:28:43,705 --> 00:28:44,825
especially for you. It
is the best fortune lot.

583
00:28:44,905 --> 00:28:47,345
The monk said you are certain
to pass the imperial examination.

584
00:28:47,425 --> 00:28:48,345
May my writing earn me
a place in government,

585
00:28:49,825 --> 00:28:50,905
change my fate,

586
00:28:52,265 --> 00:28:54,305
and let me protect those dearest to me.

587
00:29:02,305 --> 00:29:04,905
I have tried so hard.

588
00:29:04,985 --> 00:29:06,745
I really have tried so hard.

589
00:29:09,105 --> 00:29:10,105
Mengmeng.

590
00:29:10,185 --> 00:29:11,545
I know.

591
00:29:12,105 --> 00:29:13,745
I have seen it all.

592
00:29:14,865 --> 00:29:16,025
Even if you fail the examination,

593
00:29:17,025 --> 00:29:19,065
you will still be the finest
Meng Tinghui in the world.

594
00:29:19,145 --> 00:29:21,465
There is only one Meng Tinghui like you.

595
00:29:21,545 --> 00:29:22,385
Fuzhi.

596
00:29:22,985 --> 00:29:24,145
I became the top scholar!

597
00:29:24,225 --> 00:29:25,745
The top scholar!

598
00:29:29,345 --> 00:29:30,465
Mengmeng is right here.

599
00:29:30,545 --> 00:29:31,425
Look.

600
00:29:31,505 --> 00:29:32,905
Brilliant beyond measure.

601
00:29:32,985 --> 00:29:34,665
You have everything anyone could want.

602
00:29:34,745 --> 00:29:36,545
You are so heartless.

603
00:29:36,625 --> 00:29:38,785
We promised to return to Shazhou together.

604
00:29:38,865 --> 00:29:40,265
You broke your promise.

605
00:29:40,345 --> 00:29:41,705
You have to promise me

606
00:29:41,785 --> 00:29:43,625
that when you shelter
others from the rain,

607
00:29:43,705 --> 00:29:45,105
you will protect yourself first.

608
00:29:47,465 --> 00:29:48,585
Stop!

609
00:29:49,385 --> 00:29:50,425
Stop feeding her!

610
00:29:51,225 --> 00:29:52,225
Stop!

611
00:29:52,305 --> 00:29:54,025
Let her go!

612
00:31:01,585 --> 00:31:03,145
Please, give me an Infinity Pill.

613
00:31:04,985 --> 00:31:06,425
I will do anything you ask.

614
00:31:08,145 --> 00:31:09,585
Anything at all.

615
00:31:13,465 --> 00:31:14,585
What if I told you

616
00:31:14,665 --> 00:31:16,385
to kill Meng Tinghui?

617
00:31:16,465 --> 00:31:18,945
Fine. I will kill her.

618
00:31:19,025 --> 00:31:20,265
I will kill her.

619
00:31:21,825 --> 00:31:24,225
Fuzhi!

620
00:31:24,305 --> 00:31:25,265
Wake up!

621
00:31:36,425 --> 00:31:37,785
Proprietor Yan.

622
00:31:37,865 --> 00:31:39,065
This is Lord Meng.

623
00:31:39,825 --> 00:31:41,745
Let go!

624
00:31:44,185 --> 00:31:45,145
My lord, are you all right?

625
00:31:46,785 --> 00:31:47,825
I am here.

626
00:31:47,905 --> 00:31:49,705
Mengmeng.

627
00:31:49,785 --> 00:31:50,745
It hurts so much.

628
00:31:51,465 --> 00:31:53,785
It feels like bugs are
gnawing all over me.

629
00:31:55,305 --> 00:31:57,585
Please kill me.

630
00:31:57,665 --> 00:31:58,505
There are bugs.

631
00:31:59,545 --> 00:32:00,785
They are biting me.

632
00:32:01,545 --> 00:32:02,585
They are gnawing at my bones.

633
00:32:02,665 --> 00:32:03,665
I cannot bear it.

634
00:32:03,745 --> 00:32:05,505
Yinqing, quickly!

635
00:32:07,465 --> 00:32:08,305
Careful.

636
00:32:09,585 --> 00:32:10,705
Slowly.

637
00:32:12,185 --> 00:32:13,465
Fuzhi, slowly.

638
00:32:28,505 --> 00:32:29,345
Mengmeng.

639
00:32:30,425 --> 00:32:32,145
Kill me.

640
00:32:32,225 --> 00:32:33,545
Please.

641
00:32:34,625 --> 00:32:35,825
If you die,

642
00:32:37,545 --> 00:32:38,865
what am I supposed to do?

643
00:32:41,345 --> 00:32:42,825
If anything happens to you,

644
00:32:44,705 --> 00:32:46,305
I will not go on living either.

645
00:32:59,185 --> 00:33:00,065
I have an Infinity Pill here.

646
00:33:04,865 --> 00:33:05,905
Give it to me.

647
00:33:05,985 --> 00:33:06,825
Give me the Infinity Pill!

648
00:33:06,905 --> 00:33:07,905
Fuzhi!

649
00:33:11,385 --> 00:33:12,225
Give it to me!

650
00:33:17,745 --> 00:33:18,585
Shen Zhishu!

651
00:33:18,665 --> 00:33:20,185
Are you trying to make
her die even sooner?

652
00:33:20,265 --> 00:33:22,225
Do you want to watch her die in agony?

653
00:33:22,305 --> 00:33:23,185
Meng Tinghui!

654
00:33:23,265 --> 00:33:24,625
You are supposed to be her closest friend.

655
00:33:24,705 --> 00:33:26,825
Can you not even let
her die with less pain?

656
00:33:29,265 --> 00:33:30,345
She will not die.

657
00:33:32,545 --> 00:33:34,025
She absolutely will not die.

658
00:33:39,425 --> 00:33:40,705
If she really...

659
00:33:45,065 --> 00:33:46,545
If she really...

660
00:33:47,945 --> 00:33:49,625
then I will go with her.

661
00:33:53,905 --> 00:33:55,185
On the road to the afterlife,

662
00:33:55,705 --> 00:33:57,905
I will never let you be alone.

663
00:33:58,905 --> 00:33:59,945
I just...

664
00:34:00,985 --> 00:34:02,385
do not want to see her suffer like this.

665
00:34:04,105 --> 00:34:04,945
Lady Meng.

666
00:34:05,825 --> 00:34:06,865
Huiyin House's caravans

667
00:34:06,945 --> 00:34:07,905
travel to the border year-round

668
00:34:07,985 --> 00:34:09,225
to obtain these Ice Soul Pills.

669
00:34:09,305 --> 00:34:11,065
They counter the heat toxin
of Five-Stone Powder.

670
00:34:11,145 --> 00:34:13,105
-Fuzhi.
-It won't cure the Infinity Pill,

671
00:34:13,185 --> 00:34:14,385
but the two poisons are quite similar.

672
00:34:15,585 --> 00:34:16,665
With her life hanging in the balance,

673
00:34:16,745 --> 00:34:19,145
I hope this pill gives
you a chance to save her.

674
00:34:19,825 --> 00:34:22,025
My lord, it is not a perfect
match for her condition,

675
00:34:22,105 --> 00:34:22,945
but it is worth trying.

676
00:34:39,105 --> 00:34:39,945
Fuzhi.

677
00:34:41,665 --> 00:34:43,105
If this road leads to death,

678
00:34:44,505 --> 00:34:45,865
I will walk it with you.

679
00:34:51,425 --> 00:34:52,745
-Fuzhi.
-Let me examine her.

680
00:34:52,825 --> 00:34:53,905
Fuzhi.

681
00:34:56,865 --> 00:34:57,745
Fuzhi.

682
00:34:59,105 --> 00:35:00,625
Her pulse is faint as a thread,

683
00:35:01,145 --> 00:35:02,305
but it has not stopped.

684
00:35:03,745 --> 00:35:04,905
If by midnight tonight

685
00:35:04,985 --> 00:35:06,465
the heat toxin does not flare up again,

686
00:35:06,545 --> 00:35:08,025
she will have escaped death.

687
00:35:17,785 --> 00:35:20,105
We owe much to Lady Situ
for her generous help.

688
00:35:20,665 --> 00:35:21,705
Lady Yan and Lady Meng

689
00:35:21,785 --> 00:35:23,505
once treated me like a sister.

690
00:35:23,585 --> 00:35:25,545
I am only doing what little I can.

691
00:35:26,105 --> 00:35:28,145
Lady Yan's danger has not passed tonight.

692
00:35:28,905 --> 00:35:30,105
I will take my leave

693
00:35:30,185 --> 00:35:31,465
so I do not disturb you all.

694
00:35:32,185 --> 00:35:33,025
It is late.

695
00:35:33,105 --> 00:35:34,145
I will see Mistress Situ out.

696
00:36:52,265 --> 00:36:53,185
Zhili.

697
00:36:53,265 --> 00:36:54,145
It is so late.

698
00:36:54,625 --> 00:36:55,665
Why are you still here?

699
00:37:09,425 --> 00:37:10,425
Why are you crying?

700
00:37:11,505 --> 00:37:12,425
Who bullied you?

701
00:37:13,385 --> 00:37:14,545
I always thought

702
00:37:15,425 --> 00:37:16,745
there was nothing in this world

703
00:37:16,825 --> 00:37:18,305
that could frighten Lady Meng.

704
00:37:18,385 --> 00:37:21,145
But when Lady Yan's
addiction seized her today,

705
00:37:21,225 --> 00:37:23,265
Lord Meng wept her heart out.

706
00:37:23,345 --> 00:37:24,785
Even my brother cried.

707
00:37:26,145 --> 00:37:26,985
A Nian.

708
00:37:27,545 --> 00:37:28,905
I am scared.

709
00:37:28,985 --> 00:37:31,465
I am afraid Lady Yan may never wake up.

710
00:37:31,545 --> 00:37:33,425
And I am even more afraid
something might happen to you.

711
00:37:37,065 --> 00:37:38,385
Zhili.

712
00:37:38,465 --> 00:37:39,745
I am back, am I not?

713
00:37:40,465 --> 00:37:41,305
I am fine.

714
00:37:44,105 --> 00:37:45,865
You are getting bolder and bolder.

715
00:37:45,945 --> 00:37:47,985
Before sunset, Guard Huang
led the Light Cavalry

716
00:37:48,065 --> 00:37:49,585
and the Divine Guard back
to the capital to report.

717
00:37:49,665 --> 00:37:51,105
Yet you dared act alone

718
00:37:51,185 --> 00:37:52,225
and stayed away all night.

719
00:37:52,305 --> 00:37:53,545
What if something had happened to you?

720
00:37:54,105 --> 00:37:55,265
Zhili.

721
00:37:55,825 --> 00:37:57,025
Does your hand hurt?

722
00:37:58,625 --> 00:37:59,865
I am back, am I not?

723
00:37:59,945 --> 00:38:01,945
Why do you make me worry so much?

724
00:38:02,465 --> 00:38:03,665
And you are still calling me Zhili?

725
00:38:03,745 --> 00:38:05,025
Do you think that because
you are grown now,

726
00:38:05,105 --> 00:38:06,425
you no longer have to listen to me?

727
00:38:06,505 --> 00:38:07,665
Call me Sister.

728
00:38:08,785 --> 00:38:09,625
Sister.

729
00:38:13,465 --> 00:38:14,625
Do not try to look pitiful now.

730
00:38:20,745 --> 00:38:21,745
Are you hurt?

731
00:38:44,025 --> 00:38:44,865
I have never seen

732
00:38:44,945 --> 00:38:46,465
my brother look that worried before.

733
00:38:47,865 --> 00:38:49,985
He actually fell for Lady Yan long ago.

734
00:38:51,105 --> 00:38:52,505
He has simply kept denying his feelings

735
00:38:52,585 --> 00:38:53,785
and refused to admit them.

736
00:38:54,625 --> 00:38:56,665
With Lady Yan in this condition,

737
00:38:56,745 --> 00:38:57,865
of course his heart is breaking.

738
00:38:58,825 --> 00:39:00,945
I hope Lady Yan makes it through tonight.

739
00:39:02,265 --> 00:39:03,785
If anything happens to her,

740
00:39:04,545 --> 00:39:05,905
that little light in my brother's eyes

741
00:39:06,465 --> 00:39:07,865
may go out forever.

742
00:39:07,945 --> 00:39:09,865
Lord Meng's whole world
would collapse too.

743
00:39:12,345 --> 00:39:14,225
I will bring Ling Yunfei to justice.

744
00:39:17,625 --> 00:39:18,985
I hope Lady Yan

745
00:39:19,065 --> 00:39:20,385
will be protected by Heaven.

746
00:39:22,265 --> 00:39:23,225
Look at you.

747
00:39:23,305 --> 00:39:25,105
How did you get hurt this badly?

748
00:39:25,185 --> 00:39:27,145
While searching for the valley
outside the capital,

749
00:39:27,225 --> 00:39:28,385
I got scratched by accident.

750
00:39:28,465 --> 00:39:29,465
It was a long journey,

751
00:39:29,545 --> 00:39:30,905
so I returned a little late.

752
00:39:30,985 --> 00:39:32,665
Did you find anything outside the capital?

753
00:39:32,745 --> 00:39:33,865
We still need more time.

754
00:39:34,425 --> 00:39:36,185
There was no word from you
for a day and a night,

755
00:39:36,265 --> 00:39:37,585
and then you came back covered in wounds.

756
00:39:37,665 --> 00:39:39,065
Do you know how worried I was?

757
00:39:42,025 --> 00:39:42,865
What are you smiling at?

758
00:39:43,425 --> 00:39:44,625
You care about me.

759
00:39:46,345 --> 00:39:48,065
When have I ever not cared about you?

760
00:39:51,385 --> 00:39:53,105
You should visit a clinic tomorrow.

761
00:39:53,185 --> 00:39:54,025
I know.

762
00:40:05,465 --> 00:40:06,505
What is this?

763
00:40:07,025 --> 00:40:09,385
I found it while searching for the valley
outside the capital.

764
00:40:09,465 --> 00:40:10,585
I heard that carrying it

765
00:40:10,665 --> 00:40:11,505
brings good luck.

766
00:40:12,505 --> 00:40:14,145
It looks like you are the one
who needs some good luck.

767
00:40:19,985 --> 00:40:20,945
Rest and let your wounds heal.

768
00:40:21,025 --> 00:40:22,145
I am going to see Lady Yan.

769
00:40:27,745 --> 00:40:28,985
I will go with you.

770
00:40:29,545 --> 00:40:30,585
You stay here and rest.

771
00:40:30,665 --> 00:40:31,585
Go home early.

772
00:40:48,185 --> 00:40:49,025
Shopkeeper.

773
00:40:50,905 --> 00:40:52,905
I wonder how Proprietor Yan is doing.

774
00:40:53,505 --> 00:40:54,465
Shopkeeper,

775
00:40:54,545 --> 00:40:56,945
you may compete fiercely in business
with Proprietor Yan,

776
00:40:57,025 --> 00:40:58,345
but you really do care about her.

777
00:40:59,385 --> 00:41:00,465
Business is business.

778
00:41:00,545 --> 00:41:03,225
But you saw how terrifying
people on the Infinity Pill can become.

779
00:41:03,305 --> 00:41:05,265
Master Zhao and Old Madam Zhao

780
00:41:05,345 --> 00:41:06,785
are both gone now.

781
00:41:09,545 --> 00:41:10,865
Proprietor Yan is a woman

782
00:41:10,945 --> 00:41:12,425
making her way in the world alone
is not easy.

783
00:41:13,145 --> 00:41:14,305
Fortunately, Lord Meng was there this time

784
00:41:14,385 --> 00:41:15,385
and managed to save her.

